":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[138.185821,36.742871]}}],"display_comment_original":"飯綱町には、地域の由緒を示す案内板や石碑を探す余地がある。 この地域には寺社や信仰の場、史跡や遺跡、城跡や陣屋跡に関わる場所が見え、矢筒城跡、芋川氏館跡、長谷寺のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに水辺の暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を示す案内板に加え、治水碑や河川改修の記念碑が狙い目になる。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["小林次郎","龍野右忠"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["牟礼宿","芋川城（若宮城）","鼻見城","矢筒城","牟礼神社御柱祭","高岡神社","大宮神社","芋川神社秋季例大祭"],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":["小林次郎 : 飯綱町出身の初代参議院事務総長 : いいづな歴史ふれあい館特別展 https://jpsearch.go.jp/item/bibnl-22928087"],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%A3%AF%E7%B6%B1%E7%94%BA","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q18818439","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11679411","https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E5%B0%8F%E6%9E%97%E6%AC%A1%E9%83%8E&keyword=%E9%A3%AF%E7%B6%B1%E7%94%BA"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"飯綱町","wikipedia_revision_id":"110039456","wikidata_qid":"Q772034","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%A3%AF%E7%B6%B1%E7%94%BA","japan_search_query_url":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E5%B0%8F%E6%9E%97%E6%AC%A1%E9%83%8E&keyword=%E9%A3%AF%E7%B6%B1%E7%94%BA","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}